                        <li>Moroccan flavor innovation (date, amlou, orange blossom, pistachio bases)</li>
                        <li>Strong digital + Instagram strategy (essential for Gen Z capture)</li>
                        <li>High-traffic location strategy (shopping centers, not standalone)</li>
